stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: create
    Created --> Observed: observe / import
    Observed --> Observed: observe
    Observed --> Traced: select exact Reflection or authored Trace
    Traced --> ReplayReady: prepare authored or deterministic Replay
    ReplayReady --> Replaying: replay action
    Replaying --> Replaying: replay action
    Replaying --> ReplayComplete: final step
    ReplayComplete --> ComparisonReady: enter Evolution
    ComparisonReady --> ComparisonReady: move observation pair
    ComparisonReady --> Comparing: start Comparative Reconstruction
    Comparing --> Comparing: comparative action
    Comparing --> ComparisonReady: back
    ComparisonReady --> ReplayComplete: back / restore comparison checkpoint
    Created --> Verified: verify
    Observed --> Verified: verify
    ReplayReady --> Verified: verify
    Replaying --> Verified: verify
    ReplayComplete --> Verified: verify
    ComparisonReady --> Verified: verify
    Comparing --> Verified: verify
    Verified --> Archived: archive
    Created --> Archived: archive
    Observed --> Archived: archive
    ReplayReady --> Archived: archive
    Replaying --> Archived: archive
    ReplayComplete --> Archived: archive
    ComparisonReady --> Archived: archive
    Comparing --> Archived: archive
    Archived --> [*]
